    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover a Card Game You've Never Heard Of \u2013 Until Now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Up\u2019s and Wipes</i> is a fast-paced, semi-strategic card game where your goal is simple: build runs and sets to shrink your total points each round. Outsmart your opponents, lower your score, and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your game settings to start on whatever round you would like, or play with as many players as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different cards and backgrounds to personalize your experience\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full mouse, controller and Keyboard support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
